*> НОД по Евклиду: (A, B) -> (B, A mod B), пока B не станет нулём. НОК = A / НОД * B.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. GCD-LCM.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-A     PIC 9(9) VALUE 48.
01 WS-B     PIC 9(9) VALUE 18.
01 WS-T     PIC 9(9).
01 WS-GCD   PIC 9(9).
01 WS-LCM   PIC 9(18).
01 WS-OUT   PIC Z(17)9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-B = 0
        COMPUTE WS-T = FUNCTION MOD(WS-A, WS-B)
        MOVE WS-B TO WS-A
        MOVE WS-T TO WS-B
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE WS-A TO WS-GCD
    COMPUTE WS-LCM = 48 / WS-GCD * 18
    MOVE WS-GCD TO WS-OUT
    DISPLAY "GCD(48, 18) = " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OUT)
    MOVE WS-LCM TO WS-OUT
    DISPLAY "LCM(48, 18) = " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-OUT)
    STOP RUN.
